WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:03.480
Okay! The end of the line is over here!

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.720
Write your event requests on this form!

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:09.010
Write your material requests on this form!

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.240
Next, please.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.370
I'm from the Theater Club.

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:17.740
We'd like to do this.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.870
A smoke machine?

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.250
The rental fee is too high.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.960
This might be a little hard to do.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.000
You're joking...

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.300
How about confetti instead?

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.340
Confetti?

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:37.300
Try using tin foil and shining light through it.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.470
I think you'll get some flashy effects.

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:41.470
Great idea.

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.390
We'll run with that!

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.060
Thank you.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.350
Next.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.190
Wow, it's hot.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:55.110
Yes. I heard the temperature will go up to about 37°C today.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.740
Yeah that, too.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.740
But I feel the heat coming from them, too.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:02.620
You're right.

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:05.620
Summer Vacation

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:09.790
Summer break starts next week, so I think everyone wants to take care of their requisitions this week.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.040
The
th

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.040
Culture

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.040
Festival

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:09.790
Yakisoba
Frankfurters

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:14.920
The Culture Festival is the greatest event at our school.

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:20.930
A fun Culture Festival that will fill everyone's heart with peace and love.

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:24.270
I'm counting on something like that, Head Organizer.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:25.730
Yes.

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:28.770
I'll do my best not to fall behind the Vice President.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.560
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.560
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.770
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibiku wa

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.770
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:41.030
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:41.030
I want to tell you, but I can't.

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:45.030
Hatenai omoi ha anata...

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:45.030
I always long for you...

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:55.460
Boukansha no hibi ni yuuki wo dashitara sayonara

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:55.460
Say goodbye to the days of just being a bystander.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:04.510
Demo "jiyuu" no teigi ni buranko no you ni yureteru no ne?

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:04.510
But am I swaying over the meaning of "Freedom", like a swing?

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:09.640
Gosenfu ni kaita kaidan

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:09.640
Stairs drawn on a music score,

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:13.140
Ippo susunde niho sagattemo

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:13.140
Even if I go down one step and back two steps,

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:17.150
Honno chotto setsunasa utau

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:17.150
The notes play a sad melody.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:20.190
Watashi no real kanjite ne

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:20.190
Hear my reality!

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:24.110
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:24.110
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:27.660
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibikuwa

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:27.660
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:31.620
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:31.620
I want to tell you, but can't

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:35.040
Zutto anata wo sagashiteta

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:35.040
I've always been searching for you.

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:39.130
Tatoeba sou anataga hikari

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:39.130
Let's say you are the light

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:42.590
Watashi ga kagede mitsume aetanara

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:42.590
And I'm the shadow, gazing at one other.

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:46.630
Namida iro no diamond

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:46.630
The tear-colored diamond

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:50.430
Nee zero kara kagayakasetai

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:50.430
I want to make it shine from nothing.

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:55.980
Kowagaranaide musunde ne ai wo

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:55.980
Don't be afraid of falling in love.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.150
Deaiwo...

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.150
Nor of meeting people...

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.320
Okay.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:06.990
Thirst

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.620
I'm done here.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.830
I'm finished, too.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.370
So have I.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.210
Then let's call it a day.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:15.290
It's summer break for crying out loud.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.000
Every day is just so stressful.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.050
Prez...

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:22.300
All you did was drink tea while sitting in the coolest place in the room.

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:25.810
I was cheering you on from behind.

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:26.640
Right?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.100
Yes, yes.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:34.150
Seriously. It's not good to work too hard.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:38.780
Oh yeah. How about we have a little party?

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.150
You can do so by yourself.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.450
Let's go back!

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:45.410
Bye.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:50.910
I just can't compete, can I?

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:54.880
Tomorrow, we'll first organize the schedule.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:59.170
Oh, have we placed an order to restock the infirmary with the basics?

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.800
She's still thinking...

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:05.510
I don't mean to quote the Prez,
but you shouldn't work too hard.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.510
I'm fine.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:12.690
Just imagining everyone enjoying themselves gives me the energy to work.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.730
You really care about everyone, don't you?

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:25.240
I feel most connected with everyone when I'm working for the school's sake.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:29.120
I feel as though I'm living as a human like everyone else.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.700
I want to live as a human!

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.330
Yeah.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.750
By the way, have you come up with ideas for the after party?

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.550
Well...

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:46.050
The after party is the big event that wraps up the Culture Festival.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:51.680
I'm counting on you to make a great one that everyone will remember forever.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.560
Okay, Head Organizer?

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:56.980
Yeah.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.110
Let me know if you come up with any good ideas.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:02.860
Yup. I'll see you tomorrow.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:36.770
It's supposed to be the house I used to live in, yet I feel no ties to it.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:40.730
So you've come.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:50.490
It appears you're doing well.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.500
Do you need me for something?

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:58.290
It seems you've found a potential Dependent.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:01.340
His name is Hasekura Kouhei, is it?

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:02.250
No, he's-

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:08.510
You haven't forgotten the promise you made with me, have you?

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:13.720
Your reason for going to school is to find a person to become your Dependent.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:17.810
Since you have, why aren't you turning him into a Dependent already?

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.520
Because...

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:21.770
But!

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:22.400
"But"?

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:37.580
In this day and age when we can supply ourselves with blood from blood banks and other alternatives,

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.210
why must we take Dependents?

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:46.800
This world is different from yours!

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:51.140
Even without taking Dependents, I can live with humans!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.640
Nonsense.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:07:01.480
You know very well that transfusion blood isn't enough to quench your thirst.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.740
What's wrong? Did I touch a nerve?

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:16.330
I'll... I'll be fine!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.830
No matter how great the thirst, I will endure it.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:24.170
I will not live as you order me to!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:34.300
So! With Iorin's gracious offer...

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:37.850
...Culture Festival organizers have tomorrow completely off!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.100
You will forget all work for a day...

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:42.270
...And play all you want!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.360
So, Prez was serious about it.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.740
How dare he bring Yuki-san into this...

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:58.410
So I, Yuki Kanade, have personally come up with the "one-day-only enjoy summer" plan!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.330
When you hear of summer, you think of the ocean.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.080
When you hear of the ocean, you think of summer.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:06.500
First, we'll go to the beach!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.840
That's... the beach?

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:15.550
After a swim, we watch the fireworks in yukatas!

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.890
Fireworks?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.560
White beach. Blue ocean.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:25.980
Fireworks will brighten the sky and shine their light upon the sexy girls dressed in yukatas.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:30.820
There's no better plan to enjoy the summer with everyone, is there?

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:33.280
"Everyone"?

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.160
I guess a day won't hurt.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:39.410
You should have fun with everyone tomorrow, too.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.290
Sure.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.000
Maybe it won't be so bad...

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:47.250
Um.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:54.130
Unfortunately, Nii-sama and I have dance practice tomorrow.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.840
Dance practice?

00:08:55.840 --> 00:09:01.220
It's the dance performed and presented to the gods during the Autumn Festival at Tamatsu Island Shrine.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:07.480
Events concerning Tamatsu Island Shrine are among the most important to the Togis.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:10.650
The dance is certainly something worth watching.

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:15.150
I was looking forward to having fun with everyone...

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:19.870
How about we watch the fireworks at Tamatsu Island Shrine?

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:23.540
Then Sei-chan and Shiro-chan can participate!

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.790
Nice idea, Hina-chan!

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:27.120
I can?

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.800
It should not be a problem if it's after practice.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.090
Really, Nii-sama?

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.800
Thank you very much.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.800
I'm looking forward to it very much!

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.940
Then tomorrow, we'll meet up at 8am!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:47.810
Yeah!

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.490
A trip to the beach with everyone.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.990
A one-day-only summer break.

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.660
It's just one day. I'll be fine.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:08.170
I'm a human like everyone else.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.050
Summer!

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:17.510
And... the beach!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.520
Feels great!

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:32.020
Good thing the weather kept up.

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:38.150
Come on! Summer's going to end if you don't hurry.

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:39.950
Talk about exaggeration.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.160
She's not entirely wrong.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.910
It's a precious holiday.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.790
You'll regret it if you don't enjoy it fully!

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:50.670
Wow!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.710
W-Wow...

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:59.970
Right there! Go!

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:59.970
No, wait!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:07.350
Ready?

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:09.730
Here goes!

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.230
Hey, where are you hitting it?

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:14.650
Hina-chan!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.280
Sendo-san!

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.040
Yay!

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.170
Nice one, Eririn!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.210
Two-on-three isn't fair!

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.800
The workout made me hungry.

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:41.800
I brought gelatin drinks for dessert.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:43.760
We should go, too.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:46.510
Y-Yeah.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:10.700
It was delicious. Did you have plenty?

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:13.040
I had too much.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.330
Plenty!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:22.760
Is it affecting me already?

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:28.060
I'm sorry.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:30.100
Hasekura-kun.

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:34.390
Did I surprise you?

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.730
Yes... Well... You did.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:39.650
For you.

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:41.820
Thank you.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.410
It was so fast.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:47.910
What was?

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:52.540
Time flew.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.870
If feels like we came to the beach only minutes ago, and look.

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:03.340
Yes. Time passes quickly when you're having fun.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:08.350
When we wish something to end quickly, it doesn't at all.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:12.060
Do you think the Culture Festival will go by in a flash, too?

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:14.730
But it will be remembered forever.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:20.900
Fun memories will not fade; they shine in people's hearts forever.

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:26.910
That's why I want the Culture Festival to be fun...
something that will get etched into everyone's hearts...

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:31.540
...so that even after graduation, it will let them return to that fun time at any time.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:36.540
I wish the day will be a pleasant memory like that for everyone.

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:41.960
Yeah.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:42.670
And also...

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:44.210
Also?

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:51.640
I hope it will be a good memory for you, too.

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:57.730
Thank you. That's the first time anyone has said anything like that to me.

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:00.270
You just work too hard.

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:04.230
For the school is good and all, but you need to have fun, too.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:08.240
Don't worry. I had lots of fun today.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:08.910
Really?

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:09.950
Yes.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:12.410
That's great, then.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.040
Let's get going.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.290
I bet Shiro-chan's waiting for us.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.420
You're right.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:22.250
Here.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.300
Yup.

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:29.890
Vice Prez?

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.890
I-I'm sorry. I'll be going on ahead.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.650
What was that all about suddenly?

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.480
Is she reaching her limits?

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:47.400
Prez.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:52.240
What do you mean, "limits"?

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.660
Just as the word implies.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:58.120
Erika's short on blood.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.580
Blood? But-

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:05.590
Hasekura-kun, you've heard about Dependents from Erika, right?

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:08.720
But Vice Prez said she wants to live as a human!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.300
Because of that, she won't drink anyone's blood nor make Dependents.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:20.560
But in reality, if we keep ourselves from blood too long, we're attacked by strong vampiric impulses.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:26.320
Resisting and fighting against that instinct is a hellish torture.

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:29.950
Erika is starting to show signs of it.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.150
What?

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:35.990
But isn't blood for transfusions for times like this?

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:38.830
Come on, Hasekura-kun.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:46.420
Erika wants to live like a human girl. Do you think she would bring something like that in her purse?

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:54.340
Besides, in Erika's case, she's far beyond
the point of anything like that helping her.

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:59.810
Anyway, she's my stubborn sister who won't listen once her mind is set.

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:04.060
I hope things won't go wrong due to her resisting too much.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:09.150
In case of emergency, I'm counting on
your assistance, Hasekura Kouhei-kun.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:26.750
Tamatsu Island Shrine worships the Earth gods.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:30.670
In the old days, the Togis were priests here.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:37.260
Now, people from outside the island are hired and work here as priests,

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:42.520
but ancient duties that have been passed down for generations are still carried out by the Togis.

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:45.560
One of them is the Autumn Festival.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:47.360
Yes?

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.070
Oh, nothing.

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:52.570
Okay then.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:57.740
By any chance, are you not feeling well?

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:03.910
Like headaches or chest pains...

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.790
Not really. Why?

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.540
If you're okay, then never mind.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.300
You're acting strange.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:23.060
It... still hasn't gone away.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:26.940
I'll be fine...

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:29.020
I'm okay.

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.070
Please. Go away.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.160
Everyone!

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.300
Shiro-chan! You're so lovely in your yukata!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.090
Sorry to make you wait.

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.260
Good evening.

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.090
Hi.

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:59.260
You're finished with practice?

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:04.020
Yes, since we'll be watching the fireworks, Nii-sama ended it early.

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.140
You've got a soft side, don't you, Sei-chan?

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.690
Today is special.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:13.820
Everything has been prepared, so you can all change there.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:21.530
Thanks for waiting!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:24.540
Tada!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:25.660
What do you think?

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:26.960
Do we look good?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.080
I guess fine feathers make fine birds.

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:31.790
I figured that was coming.

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:41.680
Vice Prez...

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:50.400
What a view.

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.020
I can't wait.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.160
It's not going away...

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:04.580
What should I do? At this rate...

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.040
Vice Prez.

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:08.870
Are you all right?

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:10.500
Yeah...

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:12.920
Really? You look pale.

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:17.670
I'm really fine. Thank you for your concern.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:19.880
Vice Prez...

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.060
It's begun!

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.650
Okay everyone, let's watch it up closer!

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:41.700
I'm sorry!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:47.620
Iorin!

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.120
Iori.

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:51.790
My bad.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:55.630
Another one.

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.050
Wow.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:58.050
Hey, Vice Pre-

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:11.730
I can't... I can't... I can't...

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:05.700
Vice Prez!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:12.160
No!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:30.180
No... Don't come any closer...

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:32.680
Vice Prez!

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:35.310
No! Let go of me!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.600
Why?

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:39.900
Vice Prez!

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:39.370
I miss you

00:22:49.880 --> 00:22:59.520
Mabushii kurai e ni kaita jikan nano

00:22:49.880 --> 00:22:59.520
Just like in a perfect painting,

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:04.270
Sou ima ha...

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:04.270
Now is a dazzling moment.

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:18.330
Kawari hajimeta machinami ni me wo sorashi

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:18.330
I look away from the city that's starting to change

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:24.040
Omoide ha tada iuno

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:24.040
And my memories whisper to me, saying,

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:31.180
Soko de tomadou dake

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:31.180
You're only at a loss.

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:33.180
I miss you

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:37.430
Omoi wo sono mama dakishimete

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:37.430
Hold on to your feelings.

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:39.350
I miss you

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:43.690
Kawaranu omoi wo shiritai no

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:43.690
I want to know how you've always felt.

00:23:43.690 --> 00:23:45.570
I miss you

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:49.320
Negatteru kara

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:49.320
I'll always long for you, so...

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:55.330
I miss you...

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:20.060
Eleventh Episode

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:20.060
「Parting」

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:07.750
Anticipation and anxiety.

00:24:07.750 --> 00:24:09.920
Despair and the smallest hope.

00:24:10.510 --> 00:24:14.800
The one choice takes everything to darkness.

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:18.560
Where is tomorrow for the lost lamb?

00:24:18.560 --> 00:24:20.060
Like that?
